#NOTE: when creating new source directories, update the /meta/sources hierarchy!

# Use the following format
# Field 1: blank space or '*' for deleted, '#' for commented line
# Field 2: Start of Assigned Range for Source Atom ID
# Field 3: End of Assigned Range for Source Atom ID
# Filed 4: SAB{<Termgroup>,<Termgroup>, etc.} - local path to classes file
# ex. MSH2002{HT,MH,EP,EN,PM,NM,N1,CE,TQ,XQ} - /lti10h/META02/classes_atoms.src
# each SAB should have a set of curly brackets after it, even if those
# brackets are empty
#
# ALSO, some records are commented out ('#') to allow for automated processing of
# ranges by scripts

*|  min_id|  max_id|termgrp - /path/to/ATOMS_file	("*" = deleted)
